<title>USA: Applied Power says completes acquisition.</title>
<headline>Applied Power says completes acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>MILWAUKEE 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Applied Power Inc said it completed its acquisition of Everest Electronic Equipment for about $52 million.</p>
<p>California-based Everest makes electronic enclosures for computers, telephones and other devices.</p>
<p>Applied Power makes hydraulic and vibration control products, industrial and electrical tools and consumables and furnishings and enclosures for technical equipment.</p>
<p>--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
